Well, I'll be damned.

238
00:10:14,020 --> 00:10:15,740
Bob is an animal rights activist.

239
00:10:16,200 --> 00:10:17,620
He doesn't believe in harming animals.

240
00:10:18,540 --> 00:10:18,840
Dinner's ready.

241
00:10:19,340 --> 00:10:21,260
Let's go out to the patio where the pig is roasting.

242
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:22,780
Roast pig?

243
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:24,780
I'm a vegetarian.

244
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:35,270
This is a very scary topic for a lot of people.

245
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:41,160
I think they get very nervous introducing themselves because in this case, Bob is going to be marrying Cindy.

246
00:10:41,160 --> 00:10:43,150
So these are going to be his in-laws forever.

247
00:10:43,910 --> 00:10:56,250
Yeah, and it seems interesting, the differences, as you mentioned before, between the father-in-law who's very much into hunting and drinks and likes roast pig, whereas this guy is more of an animal rights activist, doesn't drink.

248
00:10:56,730 --> 00:10:57,450
He's a vegetarian.

249
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:58,960
And a vegetarian.

250
00:10:58,960 --> 00:10:59,960
He doesn't eat meat.

251
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:01,540
So, I think it would be very complicated.

252
